  // nullable/defaulted so every pre-existing row (the wiki-ingestion
  // pipeline this model already serves) is unaffected. `summary` above
  // remains the general/website summary; `launcherSummary` is the
  // Launcher-specific shorter variant and falls back to `summary` when
